   "text": "Lie on your left side, knees bent, head on a pillow; right hand on the floor in front of the chest."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.5,
   "end": 25.51,
   "text": "Slide the right hand forward along the floor, so that the right shoulder blade comes forward. Come back."
  },
  {
